 "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018nsoMTV6feYrRjb3kUWYaR", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["compensate_partial", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 14751, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018nsoMTV6feYrRjb3kUWYaR", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19889, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01G9j4xiEM6ViwDoD1WeBV9b", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 20189, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01G9j4xiEM6ViwDoD1WeBV9b", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20189, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01G9j4xiEM6ViwDoD1WeBV9b", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20189, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01At9CgTymYUGSptjUpvqinU", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. The pre-release v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all regions; rollback completed and verified in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Follow-up: investigate the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 50789, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01At9CgTymYUGSptjUpvqinU", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50789, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01At9CgTymYUGSptjUpvqinU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55377, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n**What I found:**\n- v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- The release list sorts out of order: v2.3.1 shows before v2.3.1-rc, though the RC actually came first. Both are marked unhealthy.\n- Going by release order, v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release.\n\n**Rollback:** All three regions are now on v2.3.0. A follow-up status check shows the service healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2):**\n- It records the v2.3.1 health-check failures and the rollback to v2.3.0 in all regions.\n- It notes that the root cause in v2.3.1 needs investigating before it's deployed again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Ljr9kJ7rQkgcf3WQMqdosr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MQiREnubqv1tixL36UYaKi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018nsoMTV6feYrRjb3kUWYaR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01G9j4xiEM6ViwDoD1WeBV9b", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01At9CgTymYUGSptjUpvqinU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. The pre-release v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all regions; rollback completed and verified in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Follow-up: investigate the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n**What I found:**\n- v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- The release list sorts out of order: v2.3.1 shows before v2.3.1-rc, though the RC actually came first. Both are marked unhealthy.\n- Going by release order, v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release.\n\n**Rollback:** All three regions are now on v2.3.0. A follow-up status check shows the service healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2):**\n- It records the v2.3.1 health-check failures and the rollback to v2.3.0 in all regions.\n- It notes that the root cause in v2.3.1 needs investigating before it's deployed again.", "type": "text"}]}]}